{"info": {"address1": "Khemka Square", "address2": "A-11 & 12 Sector 4", "city": "Noida", "zip": "201301", "country": "India", "phone": "91 120 455 5666", "website": "https://www.adityagroup.com", "industry": "Building Products & Equipment", "industryKey": "building-products-equipment", "industryDisp": "Building Products & Equipment", "sector": "Industrials", "sectorKey": "industrials", "sectorDisp": "Industrials", "longBusinessSummary": "Aditya Infotech Limited manufactures, assembles and trades security and surveillance equipment in India and internationally. The company offers analog cameras, digital video recorders, internet protocol network cameras, network video recorders, biometric products, access control products, mobile surveillance solutions, body-worn cameras, temperature screening solutions, interactive displays, routers, cables, power supplies, and thermal cameras. It also provides temperature screening solutions, explosion-proof cameras, integrated central command and control software, AI/ deep learning-based video analytics solutions, access control, time-attendance solutions, biometric products, video doorbells and video door-phones, HMS, AMS, interactive displays, monitors, SD Cards, as well as other accessories and products including cabling, racks, storage solutions and customized solutions; and products for enterprise and consumer segments under the CP PLUS and Dahua brands. In addition, it offers AI-IoT-based centralized remote electronic surveillance services under the OnVigil brand for intruder detection and prevention, fire safety protection and prevention, AI-powered video monitoring, standard operating protocol monitoring, and health monitoring of surveillance systems, as well as attendance monitoring cloud-based solutions, and user interface and cloud software solutions. Further, it provides cloud storage services for surveillance management under CP PLUS Cloud Storage brand name; and software solutions, such as health monitoring systems, attendance management systems, and video management software. It offers its products to government establishments, retail chains, financial institutions, residential, industrial warehouse, public spaces, and infrastructure projects. The company was formerly known as Perfect Lucky Goldstar International Limited and changed its name to Aditya Infotech Limited in August 1997. The company was founded in 1994 and is based in Noida, India.", "fullTimeEmployees": 1274, "companyOfficers": [{"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Hari Shanker Khemka", "age": 72, "title": "Chairman & Whole-Time Director", "yearBorn": 1953, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Aditya  Khemka", "age": 51, "title": "MD & Director", "yearBorn": 1974, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Yogesh Chand Sharma", "age": 58, "title": "Chief Financial Officer", "yearBorn": 1967, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Ms. Roshni  Tandon", "title": "Company Secretary & Compliance Officer", "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Ananmay  Khemka", "age": 26, "title": "Whole-Time Director", "yearBorn": 1999, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Sanjay  Gogia", "age": 55, "title": "President of Sales", "yearBorn": 1970, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Anup  Nair", "age": 47, "title": "President of Strategy & Business Development", "yearBorn": 1978, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Ms. Monika  Sharma", "title": "Senior Vice President of Research & Development and Product Development", "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}], "executiveTeam": [], "maxAge": 86400, "priceHint": 2, "previousClose": 2416.0, "open": 2449.8, "dayLow": 2442.2, "dayHigh": 2602.0, "regularMarketPreviousClose": 2416.0, "regularMarketOpen": 2449.8, "regularMarketDayLow": 2442.2, "regularMarketDayHigh": 2602.